<title>USA: BADMINTON-FRIDAY'S RESULTS AT U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-FRIDAY'S RESULTS AT U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, California 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>at the U.S. Open Badminton Championships on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>1-Joko Suprianto (Indonesia) beat Fung Permadi (Taiwan) 15-6</p>
<p>15-8</p>
<p>2-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat Rashid Sidek</p>
<p>(Malaysia) 15-13 15-3</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Denyse Julien (Canada) 11-5</p>
<p>11-0</p>
<p>2-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat Meiluawaty (Indonesia) 11-4</p>
<p>10-12 11-3</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Chandra Wijaya/Sigit (Indonesia) beat 1-Denny</p>
<p>Kantono/Antonius (Indonesia) 9-15 15-10 15-6</p>
<p>2-Yap Kim Hock/Cheah Soon Kit (Malaysia) beat Ha Tae Kwon/Kim</p>
<p>Dong Mun (South Korea) 15-6 9-15 15-12</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>1-Rosalina Zelin/Eliza (Indonesia) beat Kim Shin Young/Chung</p>
<p>So Young (South Korea) 15-4 15-2</p>
<p>2-Joanne Goode/Julie Bradbury (Britain) beat Indarti</p>
<p>Isoliana/Deyana Lomban (Indonesia) 15-7 15-7</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Kim Dong Moon/Chung So Young (South Korea) beat Nick</p>
<p>Ponting/Joanne Goode (Britain) 15-9 15-5</p>
<p>Chris Hunt (Britain)/Helene Kirkegaard (Denmark) beat 2-Simon</p>
<p>Archer/Julie Bradbury (Britain) 15-7 12-15 15-12</p>
</text>
